    <string-array name="planet_lore">
        <item>A warm world of long afternoons. Its envoys sleep two thirds of the day and consider every box an embassy.</item>
        <item>A planet of packs and smells. Its envoys love openly and read the world through the nose.</item>
        <item>A loud green world. Its envoys talk, mimic and never forgive boredom.</item>
        <item>A planet of burrows and fresh grass. Its envoys are cautious, chew constantly and notice everything.</item>
        <item>A world of tunnels. Its envoys sleep like stones and play like whirlwinds.</item>
        <item>A hot, slow planet. Its envoys live by the sun and the thermometer.</item>
    </string-array>
